sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CLI as harness-evolve CLI
    participant Driver as Loop driver
    participant Eval as Eval harness
    participant API as OnClaw server
    participant Agent as Live agent h_t
    participant Mine as Miner
    participant LLM as Side-call LLM
    participant Prop as Proposer
    participant Shadow as Shadow builder
    participant DB as HarnessStore

    Note over CLI,DB: Round t of T — stages 1, 2, 3 in order

    CLI->>Driver: start agent, suite, rounds, repeats
    Driver->>DB: load active lineage h_t

    rect rgb(230, 244, 255)
        Note over Driver,Eval: STAGE 1 — Weakness Mining
        Driver->>Eval: eval baseline h_t on D_in + D_ho
        Eval->>API: seed scripted fixture sessions (once)
        loop each split, each repeat
            Eval->>API: drive question via /v1/responses
            API->>Agent: compose docs + prefetch, run turn
            Agent-->>API: answer + tool cards + trace
            API-->>Eval: transcript
        end
        Eval->>Eval: grade answers (ScoreQuestion arms)
        Eval->>DB: persist eval rounds per split
        Eval-->>Driver: scoreboard, P_in and P_ho
        loop each failed question
            Driver->>Mine: attribute (question, trace, failing arm)
            Mine->>LLM: forced-JSON attribution call
            LLM-->>Mine: signature (cause, causal status, mechanism)
        end
        Mine->>Mine: exact-match clustering by signature
        Mine->>DB: persist signatures + evidence bundle B_t
    end

    rect rgb(235, 255, 235)
        Note over Driver,Prop: STAGE 2 — Harness Proposal
        Driver->>Prop: propose (B_t, declared surfaces, passing set, edit history)
        loop K parallel proposal branches (fan-out)
            Prop->>LLM: proposal call j
            LLM-->>Prop: delta Δj + audit record aj
        end
        Prop->>Prop: distinctness + addressability filters
        Prop->>DB: persist proposals, status proposed
    end

    rect rgb(255, 246, 230)
        Note over Driver,Shadow: STAGE 3 — Proposal Validation
        loop each surviving candidate Δj
            Driver->>Shadow: apply Δj to snapshot copy
            Shadow->>API: create temp agent, write prompt docs, set knobs
            Shadow-->>Driver: candidate harness materialized
            Driver->>Eval: eval candidate on D_in + D_ho, 2 repeats
            Eval->>API: drive questions against shadow agent
            Eval->>DB: persist candidate eval rounds
            Eval-->>Driver: P_in(j), P_ho(j)
            Driver->>Driver: acceptance rule: Δin ≥ 0 and Δho ≥ 0 and max > 0
            alt accepted, autonomy full
                Driver->>DB: proposal accepted
            else accepted, autonomy approval or suggest
                Driver->>DB: stays proposed, waits for human promote
            else rejected or no-op
                Driver->>DB: proposal rejected, logged only
            end
            Driver->>Shadow: delete shadow agent
        end
    end

    opt when at least one accepted, autonomy full
        Driver->>API: write merged docs and knobs to live agent
        Driver->>DB: lineage h_t+1 active, h_t retired
    end

    Driver-->>CLI: round summary (lineage, accepted, rejected)
